{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":-500,"y":-200,"width":5000,"height":370,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# Number theory and RSA\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n# 数论与 RSA\n\n[[01_Math/07-Mathematics for Computer Science/02_数论与RSA|连续阅读：从整数相除到消息还原]] · [[01_Math/07-Mathematics for Computer Science/02_Structures#Session 12 — GCDs|课堂题与原始材料]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nRead sections 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5; section 6 reuses proof tools. Each title opens the exact shared atom, and each arrow names a specific relationship. Colours distinguish sections, not mastery.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n按 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 阅读；第 6 区复用已有证明工具。卡片标题打开精确共享原子，箭头说明具体关系。颜色只区分板块，不表示掌握度。"},
		{"id":"g1","type":"group","x":-500,"y":260,"width":1500,"height":1520,"label":"1 · Integer relations and gcd construction · 整数关系与 gcd 构造","color":"4"},
		{"id":"g2","type":"group","x":-500,"y":2050,"width":1500,"height":1600,"label":"2 · Primes and common multiples · 素数与公倍数","color":"5"},
		{"id":"g3","type":"group","x":1250,"y":260,"width":1500,"height":2040,"label":"3 · Congruence, inverses and solution classes · 同余、逆元与解类","color":"3"},
		{"id":"g4","type":"group","x":3000,"y":260,"width":1500,"height":1520,"label":"4 · Totient counts and modular exponents · 欧拉计数与模指数","color":"6"},
		{"id":"g5","type":"group","x":3000,"y":2350,"width":1500,"height":1080,"label":"5 · RSA computation, correctness and security · 计算、正确性与安全","color":"2"},
		{"id":"g6","type":"group","x":1250,"y":2570,"width":1000,"height":1000,"label":"6 · 共享证明工具","color":"4"},
		{"id":"n001","type":"text","x":-460,"y":340,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[整除|Divisibility]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*整除*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor integers, a divides b when b = ak for an integer k. This relation also allows 0 to divide 0.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数关系：存在整数 k 使 b = ak；也允许 0 整除 0。"},
		{"id":"n002","type":"text","x":420,"y":340,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[带余除法|Division with remainder]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*带余除法*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor integer a and positive integer n, a = qn + r has a unique integer pair with 0 ≤ r < n.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数 a、正整数 n：a = qn + r，0 ≤ r < n，整数商余数对唯一。"},
		{"id":"n003","type":"text","x":-460,"y":860,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[最大公因数|Greatest common divisor]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*最大公因数*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor inputs not both zero, the greatest positive common divisor. Gcd 1 means coprime; gcd(0,0) = 0 is a separate convention.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n不全为零时取最大正公因数；gcd 为 1 叫互素。gcd(0,0) = 0 是单独约定。"},
		{"id":"n004","type":"text","x":420,"y":860,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[欧几里得算法|Euclidean algorithm]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*欧几里得算法*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nStart with absolute values. While y > 0, let r be the remainder of x divided by y, then replace (x,y) by (y,r): gcd stays fixed and 0 ≤ r < y. Return x at y = 0.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先取绝对值。y > 0 时令 r 为 x 除以 y 的余数，再以 (y,r) 替换 (x,y)：gcd 不变，0 ≤ r < y。y = 0 时返回 x。"},
		{"id":"n005","type":"text","x":-460,"y":1380,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Bézout等式|Bézout's identity]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*Bézout 等式*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor integers a,b not both zero, some integers s,t satisfy sa + tb = gcd(a,b). The coefficients need not be unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数 a,b 不全为零时，存在整数 s,t 使 sa + tb = gcd(a,b)；系数不必唯一。"},
		{"id":"n006","type":"text","x":420,"y":1380,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[扩展欧几里得算法|Extended Euclidean algorithm]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*扩展欧几里得算法*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTrack coefficients of the original inputs alongside each remainder. At exit, return the gcd row and its coefficients.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n随余数跟踪相对原输入的系数；退出时返回 gcd 所在行及该行系数。"},
		{"id":"n007","type":"text","x":-460,"y":2130,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[素数|Prime numbers]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*素数*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA prime is an integer greater than 1 whose positive divisors are exactly 1 and itself.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n大于 1，正因子恰好是 1 和自身。"},
		{"id":"n008","type":"text","x":420,"y":2130,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[素数整除乘积|Euclid's lemma]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*素数整除乘积*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIf prime p divides ab, it divides a or b (possibly both). The proof uses Bézout, before unique factorization.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n素数 p 整除 ab，则整除 a 或 b，也可能二者都整除；用 Bézout 证明，不预设唯一分解。"},
		{"id":"n009","type":"text","x":420,"y":2650,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[唯一素因数分解|Unique prime factorization]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*唯一素因数分解*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEvery integer n ≥ 2 has a prime factorization, unique up to order with repetitions retained. Existence and uniqueness need separate proofs.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数 n ≥ 2 可分解成素数乘积；计入重复后，仅顺序可变。存在性与唯一性分别证明。"},
		{"id":"n027","type":"text","x":-460,"y":2650,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[最小公倍数|Least common multiple]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*最小公倍数*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor two positive integers, the smallest positive common multiple. Every integer common multiple is a multiple of this number.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两个正整数的最小正公倍数；全部整数公倍数都重复这个步长。"},
		{"id":"n028","type":"text","x":-460,"y":3170,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[公因公倍乘积|GCD–LCM product identity]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*公因公倍乘积*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor two positive inputs a,b, gcd(a,b) · lcm(a,b) = ab. Prime exponents use min and max; their sum restores both input counts.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两个正整数：gcd 与 lcm 的乘积等于 ab。逐素数取最小、最大次数，相加还原两数次数之和。"},
		{"id":"n010","type":"text","x":1290,"y":340,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[同余|Congruence]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*同余*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFix an integer modulus n > 1. Integers a,b are congruent when n divides a − b; they have the same standard remainder.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定整数模数 n > 1；n 整除 a − b 等价于两数标准余数相同。"},
		{"id":"n011","type":"text","x":2170,"y":340,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[模运算|Modular arithmetic]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*模运算*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAdd, subtract or multiply residue classes by using representatives. Taking remainders preserves these operations; exponent reduction needs its own conditions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n用代表元进行类上的加减乘，逐步取余不改变结果；缩减指数要另查条件。"},
		{"id":"n012","type":"text","x":1290,"y":860,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[模逆元|Modular inverse]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*模逆元*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor n > 1, au ≡ 1 (mod n) makes u an inverse representative of a. If it exists, the class is unique; its integer representatives are not.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nn > 1 时，au ≡ 1 (mod n)；存在时逆元类唯一，但整数代表不唯一。"},
		{"id":"n013","type":"text","x":2170,"y":860,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[模逆元存在条件|Inverse-existence criterion]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*模逆元存在条件*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor integer a and n > 1, an inverse exists exactly when gcd(a,n) = 1. Bézout supplies the coefficient of a as an inverse.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数 a、n > 1：可逆当且仅当 gcd(a,n) = 1；Bézout 中 a 的系数给出逆元。"},
		{"id":"n029","type":"text","x":1290,"y":1380,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[线性同余方程|Linear congruences]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*线性同余方程*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nGiven integers a,b and n > 1, find integer x with ax ≡ b (mod n). A solution class contains infinitely many integer solutions; a = 0 is allowed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n已知整数 a,b、n > 1，求 ax ≡ b (mod n) 的整数 x。一个解类含无穷多整数解；允许 a = 0。"},
		{"id":"n014","type":"text","x":2170,"y":1380,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[同余消去律|Cancellation in congruences]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*同余消去律*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor integer n > 1, set d = gcd(c,n). Then ca ≡ cb (mod n) iff n/d divides a − b. Same-modulus cancellation for all a,b works iff d = 1.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nd = gcd(c,n)：消去后恰为 n/d 整除 a − b；对任意 a,b 都保留原模数，当且仅当 d = 1。"},
		{"id":"n015","type":"text","x":1290,"y":1900,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[线性同余求解|Solving linear congruences]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*线性同余求解*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor ax ≡ b (mod n), let d = gcd(a,n). A solution exists iff d divides b; then there are d classes modulo n. When solvable with d = n, every integer works.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nd = gcd(a,n) 整除 b 时可解，有 d 个模 n 解类；在此前提下 d = n 时全体整数都是解。"},
		{"id":"n016","type":"text","x":2170,"y":1900,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[中国剩余定理|Chinese remainder theorem]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*中国剩余定理*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor a finite family of at least two pairwise coprime integer moduli greater than 1, any residue choices specify one class modulo their product.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n至少两个、有限且两两互素的大于 1 的整数模数：任意余数条件确定一个模乘积的类。"},
		{"id":"n017","type":"text","x":3040,"y":340,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[欧拉函数|Euler's totient]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*欧拉函数*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor positive integer n, count r = 0,…,n−1 with gcd(r,n) = 1. For n > 1 these are invertible classes; φ(1) = 1 follows directly from gcd(0,1).\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正整数 n：数满足 gcd(r,n) = 1 的标准余数。n > 1 时即可逆类数；φ(1) = 1 直接由 gcd(0,1) 得到。"},
		{"id":"n024","type":"text","x":3920,"y":340,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[素数幂欧拉函数|Totient of a prime power]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*素数幂欧拉函数*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor prime p and integer k ≥ 1, φ(pᵏ) = pᵏ − pᵏ⁻¹. Exactly the multiples of p, including zero, are excluded.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\np 为素数、整数 k ≥ 1：φ(pᵏ) = pᵏ − pᵏ⁻¹。恰好排除 p 的倍数，包括零。"},
		{"id":"n025","type":"text","x":3920,"y":1380,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[欧拉函数互素乘法性|Coprime multiplicativity]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*欧拉函数互素乘法性*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor coprime positive integers a,b, φ(ab) = φ(a)φ(b). With both > 1, CRT pairs invertible classes; a factor 1 is handled directly.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n互素正整数 a,b：φ(ab) = φ(a)φ(b)。两者 > 1 时用 CRT 配对可逆类；因子 1 直接处理。"},
		{"id":"n026","type":"text","x":3920,"y":860,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[欧拉函数乘积公式|Totient product formula]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*欧拉函数乘积公式*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor positive n, multiply n by (1 − 1/p) once for each distinct prime divisor p. Multiplicities stay inside n; an empty product gives φ(1) = 1.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正整数 n：每个互异素因子 p 各乘一次 (1 − 1/p)。重数已在 n 中；空乘积给 φ(1) = 1。"},
		{"id":"n018","type":"text","x":3040,"y":860,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[欧拉定理|Euler's theorem]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*欧拉定理*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor integers n > 1 and a with gcd(a,n) = 1, a^φ(n) ≡ 1 (mod n). Multiplication permutes the coprime classes; their product is invertible.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数 n > 1，且 gcd(a,n) = 1：a^φ(n) ≡ 1 (mod n)。乘 a 置换互素类，其乘积可逆。"},
		{"id":"n019","type":"text","x":3040,"y":1380,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[费马小定理|Fermat's little theorem]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*费马小定理*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor prime p, a not divisible by p satisfies a^(p−1) ≡ 1 (mod p). Every integer a satisfies a^p ≡ a (mod p), including the zero class.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n素数 p：p 不整除 a 时 a^(p−1) ≡ 1 (mod p)；任意整数 a 都有 a^p ≡ a (mod p)，包括零类。"},
		{"id":"n020","type":"text","x":3040,"y":2430,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[模重复平方法|Repeated squaring]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*模重复平方法*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor integers a,n with n > 1 and integer k ≥ 0, compute a^k mod n by binary digits, reducing each product. No coprimality is needed; cost counts modular multiplications.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数 a,n，n > 1、整数 k ≥ 0：按二进制位平方、相乘、取余；无需互素。计算量数的是模乘次数。"},
		{"id":"n021","type":"text","x":3920,"y":2430,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RSA公钥加密|RSA public-key encryption]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*RSA公钥加密*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTeaching construction: distinct odd primes p,q; n = pq. Choose integer 1 < e < φ(n), coprime to φ(n), and a positive inverse d. Public (n,e) transforms representatives 0 ≤ m < n.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n教学构造：互异奇素数 p,q，n = pq。整数 1 < e < φ(n) 与 φ(n) 互素，d 为正逆元；公开 (n,e)，变换 0 ≤ m < n 的代表。"},
		{"id":"n022","type":"text","x":3040,"y":2950,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RSA全消息正确性|RSA all-message correctness]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*RSA全消息正确性*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor distinct primes p,q and positive integers e,d with ed ≡ 1 modulo lcm(p−1,q−1), decryption restores every integer 0 ≤ m < pq. Split zero/nonzero modulo each prime, then combine.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\np,q 为互异素数，正整数 e,d 满足 ed ≡ 1 模 lcm(p−1,q−1)：0 ≤ m < pq 的整数代表均还原。逐素数分类，再合并。"},
		{"id":"n023","type":"text","x":3920,"y":2950,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RSA安全边界|RSA security boundaries]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*RSA安全边界*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCorrect recovery does not establish secrecy. Factoring permits inversion, but the converse is not known in general. Raw RSA is deterministic; complete schemes add encoding and assumptions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正确还原不证明保密。分解足以逆转，一般逆向等价未获证明；裸 RSA 是确定性的，完整方案另有编码与假设。"},
		{"id":"p026","type":"text","x":1290,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[不变量与部分正确性]]\n*Invariant and exit condition*\n\nEuclid 的 gcd 不变，退出时第二坐标为 0，故第一坐标为答案。"},
		{"id":"p025","type":"text","x":1810,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[秩函数与终止证明]]\n*Ranking and termination*\n\nEuclid 的余数、快速幂的指数都是严格下降的非负整数。"},
		{"id":"p017","type":"text","x":1290,"y":2960,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[强数学归纳法]]\n*Strong induction*\n\n合数拆成两个严格更小因子，分别应用假设来证明分解存在。"},
		{"id":"n030","type":"text","x":420,"y":3170,"width":540,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[素数无穷性|Infinitely many primes]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n*素数无穷性*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA finite list of primes cannot contain every prime. Its product plus 1 has a prime divisor outside the list, even when that new number is composite.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n任何有限素数清单都列不尽素数。乘积加 1 必有清单外的素因子；这个新数本身可以是合数。"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e01","fromNode":"n001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n003","toSide":"top","label":"Largest common\npositive divisor\n取最大正公因数"},
		{"id":"e02","fromNode":"n002","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n004","toSide":"top","label":"For y > 0:\n0 ≤ r < y\n余数严格小于除数"},
		{"id":"e03","fromNode":"n003","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n004","toSide":"left","label":"Compute gcd\n计算 gcd"},
		{"id":"e04","fromNode":"n004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n006","toSide":"top","label":"Track coefficients\n跟踪余数系数"},
		{"id":"e05","fromNode":"n005","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n006","toSide":"left","label":"Find coefficients\n求整数系数"},
		{"id":"e06","fromNode":"g1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"g3","toSide":"left","label":"gcd = 1:\nconstruct an inverse\n互素时构造逆元"},
		{"id":"e07","fromNode":"g1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"g2","toSide":"top","label":"Bézout proves\nEuclid’s lemma\n证明素数引理"},
		{"id":"e08","fromNode":"n007","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n008","toSide":"left","label":"Prime hypothesis\n素数条件"},
		{"id":"e09","fromNode":"n008","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n009","toSide":"top","label":"Match prime factors\nprove uniqueness\n匹配因子证明唯一性"},
		{"id":"e10","fromNode":"n027","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n028","toSide":"top","label":"Two-input\nproduct identity\n两输入乘积公式"},
		{"id":"e11","fromNode":"n009","fromSide":"left","toNode":"n028","toSide":"right","label":"Compare prime exponents\nmin + max\n比较素因子指数"},
		{"id":"e12","fromNode":"n010","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n011","toSide":"left","label":"Operate on classes\n同余类上运算"},
		{"id":"e13","fromNode":"n011","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n012","toSide":"top","label":"Undo multiplication\n撤销乘法"},
		{"id":"e14","fromNode":"n012","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n013","toSide":"left","label":"Check coprimality\n检验互素"},
		{"id":"e15","fromNode":"n013","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n014","toSide":"top","label":"gcd = 1:\nsame modulus\n互素时保留模数"},
		{"id":"e16","fromNode":"n029","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n015","toSide":"top","label":"Find every class\n求全部解类"},
		{"id":"e17","fromNode":"n014","fromSide":"left","toNode":"n015","toSide":"right","label":"Reduce, then list\noriginal classes\n缩模后列原模数类"},
		{"id":"e18","fromNode":"n013","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n016","toSide":"right","label":"Inverse constructs\nselectors\n逆元构造选择系数"},
		{"id":"e19","fromNode":"n016","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n025","toSide":"bottom","label":"CRT pairs\ninvertible classes\n配对可逆类"},
		{"id":"e20","fromNode":"n017","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n024","toSide":"left","label":"Exclude multiples\nof the prime\n剔除素数倍数"},
		{"id":"e21","fromNode":"n024","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n026","toSide":"top","label":"Prime-power counts\n素数幂计数"},
		{"id":"e22","fromNode":"n025","fromSide":"top","toNode":"n026","toSide":"bottom","label":"Combine coprime\nprime-power blocks\n合并互素素数幂"},
		{"id":"e23","fromNode":"n017","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n018","toSide":"top","label":"Permute, multiply,\nthen cancel\n置换、相乘、消去"},
		{"id":"e24","fromNode":"n018","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n019","toSide":"top","label":"Prime modulus\n素数模数"},
		{"id":"e25","fromNode":"g4","fromSide":"right","toNode":"g5","toSide":"right","label":"Fermat proves\nprime-wise recovery\n逐素数证明还原"},
		{"id":"e26","fromNode":"n020","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n021","toSide":"left","label":"Compute the powers\n计算模幂"},
		{"id":"e27","fromNode":"n021","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n022","toSide":"top","label":"Prove every\nrepresentative returns\n证明全部代表还原"},
